WEBVTT

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:03.057
Meet Mira. A fictional person, with a real LogSpace website.

00:00:03.341 --> 00:00:06.145
Photos, passing thoughts, and longer stories live together in one feed.

00:00:06.235 --> 00:00:08.836
Give a longer story its own page.

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:15.377
Sign in, write a thought, and make it yours.

00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:17.447
Publish. Every post gets a link of its own.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.485
Your words, on your website. That’s LogSpace.
